{"3740990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "烧尾宴", "steam_appid": 3740990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a detective-themed live-action interactive video game where you will play as one of two constables investigating a bizarre murder case at a remote wilderness inn. Unlike traditional choice-based gameplay, this game allows you to directly type and interact with NPCs during interrogations. The content of these interrogations is not limited to the case—NPCs will respond in wildly varied ways, rather than with cold, scripted text. Players can freely unleash their imagination based on the storyline, delving deep into the truth hidden behind the case, or simply enjoy the fun of interaction.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additionally, each constable possesses unique traits and skills, and strategic pairing can yield unexpected results. The game does not impose rigid win-or-lose conditions—players can pursue reasonable suspicions to unlock each character's unique endings.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finally, we wish you an enjoyable experience as you unravel the mystery of The Ancient unsolved cases.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a detective-themed live-action interactive video game where you will play as one of two constables investigating a bizarre murder case at a remote wilderness inn. Unlike traditional choice-based gameplay, this game allows you to directly type and interact with NPCs during interrogations. The content of these interrogations is not limited to the case—NPCs will respond in wildly varied ways, rather than with cold, scripted text. Players can freely unleash their imagination based on the storyline, delving deep into the truth hidden behind the case, or simply enjoy the fun of interaction.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additionally, each constable possesses unique traits and skills, and strategic pairing can yield unexpected results. The game does not impose rigid win-or-lose conditions—players can pursue reasonable suspicions to unlock each character's unique endings.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finally, we wish you an enjoyable experience as you unravel the mystery of The Ancient unsolved cases.</h2>", "short_description": "This detective interactive game casts you as an officer solving a murder at a remote inn. Freely type to question NPCs, who react dynamically. Uncover the truth or enjoy playful interactions—it’s your call. Immerse yourself in The Ancient unsolved cases！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740990/fc872dd307834e67402c0a558f59c421e9263b81/header.jpg?t=1773988166", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740990/6c344032fe769efe8c5932ac0f51a2335ac037f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773988166", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740990/6c344032fe769efe8c5932ac0f51a2335ac037f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773988166", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["有点正经"], "publishers": ["有点正经"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 899, "final": 899, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$8.99"}, "packages": [1316812], "package_g